#: app/templates/home.html:2
msgid "Gestion d'elevage professionnelle"
msgstr "Professional farm management"

#: app/templates/home.html:11
msgid "Tarifs"
msgstr "Pricing"

#: app/templates/home.html:27
msgid "Pense pour l'Afrique - tarifs en FCFA"
msgstr "Built for Africa - pricing in FCFA"

#: app/templates/home.html:30
msgid "La plateforme qui vous dit si votre elevage"
msgstr "The platform that tells you whether your farm"

#: app/templates/home.html:31
msgid "est vraiment rentable."
msgstr "is truly profitable."

#: app/templates/home.html:34
msgid ""
"Suivi quotidien, indice de consommation (FCR), rentabilite par lot et "
"alertes automatiques pour les elevages de poulets de chair. Multitenant, "
"securise, accessible partout."
msgstr ""
"Daily tracking, feed conversion ratio (FCR), profitability per batch "
"and automatic alerts for broiler farms. Multitenant, secure, accessible "
"everywhere."

#: app/templates/home.html:37
msgid "Creer mon compte gratuitement"
msgstr "Create my free account"

#: app/templates/home.html:38 app/templates/home.html:165
msgid "Voir les tarifs"
msgstr "View pricing"

#: app/templates/home.html:40
msgid "Formule gratuite disponible. Votre espace est pret en 1 minute."
msgstr "Free plan available. Your workspace is ready in 1 minute."

#: app/templates/home.html:46
msgid "Lot LOT-04 - Jour 21"
msgstr "Batch LOT-04 - Day 21"

#: app/templates/home.html:47
msgid "Actif"
msgstr "Active"

#: app/templates/home.html:59
msgid "FCFA de resultat net"
msgstr "FCFA net profit"

#: app/templates/home.html:65
msgid "Effectif courant"
msgstr "Current headcount"

#: app/templates/home.html:71
msgid "Taux de survie"
msgstr "Survival rate"

#: app/templates/home.html:85 app/templates/home.html:142
msgid "Donnees isolees et securisees"
msgstr "Isolated and secure data"

#: app/templates/home.html:86
msgid "Accessible sur mobile"
msgstr "Accessible on mobile"

#: app/templates/home.html:87
msgid "Tarifs en FCFA"
msgstr "Pricing in FCFA"

#: app/templates/home.html:88
msgid "Support en francais et en anglais"
msgstr "Support in French and English"

#: app/templates/home.html:97
msgid "Fonctionnalites"
msgstr "Features"

#: app/templates/home.html:98
msgid "Tout ce qu'il faut pour piloter votre elevage"
msgstr "Everything you need to run your farm"

#: app/templates/home.html:106
msgid "Performance zootechnique"
msgstr "Zootechnical performance"

#: app/templates/home.html:107
msgid ""
"Indice de consommation (FCR) calcule automatiquement et courbe de "
"croissance comparee a une reference par souche."
msgstr ""
"Feed conversion ratio (FCR) calculated automatically and growth curve "
"compared against a reference for each breed."

#: app/templates/home.html:115
msgid "Rentabilite par lot"
msgstr "Profitability per batch"

#: app/templates/home.html:116
msgid ""
"Charges (aliment, poussins, medicaments, bois), revenu de vente et "
"resultat net calcules a chaque saisie."
msgstr ""
"Costs (feed, chicks, medication, litter), sales revenue and net result "
"calculated with every entry."

#: app/templates/home.html:124
msgid "Alertes automatiques"
msgstr "Automatic alerts"

#: app/templates/home.html:125
msgid ""
"Mortalite elevee, stock faible ou observation urgente : notification "
"immediate par email au proprietaire."
msgstr ""
"High mortality, low stock or urgent observation: instant email "
"notification to the owner."

#: app/templates/home.html:133
msgid "Equipe et roles"
msgstr "Team and roles"

#: app/templates/home.html:134
msgid ""
"Proprietaire, responsable, travailleur : chacun saisit ou valide au bon "
"niveau, avec un workflow de rapport journalier."
msgstr ""
"Owner, manager, worker: everyone enters or validates at the right "
"level, with a daily report workflow."

#: app/templates/home.html:143
msgid ""
"Isolation stricte entre clients a deux niveaux, y compris au niveau de la"
" base de donnees (Row Level Security)."
msgstr ""
"Strict two-layer isolation between customers, including at the "
"database level (Row Level Security)."

#: app/templates/home.html:151
msgid "Rapports exportables"
msgstr "Exportable reports"

#: app/templates/home.html:152
msgid ""
"Rapport de lot complet (FCR, mortalite, finances) exportable en PDF pour "
"votre banquier ou votre veterinaire."
msgstr ""
"Complete batch report (FCR, mortality, finances) exportable as PDF for "
"your banker or veterinarian."

#: app/templates/home.html:163
msgid "Des tarifs accessibles, en FCFA"
msgstr "Affordable pricing, in FCFA"

#: app/templates/home.html:164
msgid "A partir de gratuit. Sans engagement. Mobile Money et carte acceptes."
msgstr "Starting free. No commitment. Mobile Money and cards accepted."

